    "probe": "Affine standardized ridge regression, alpha=10, float64 solve; fit the union of 512 fit and 128 validation rows, evaluate 256 test rows.",
    "standardization": "Feature and target means and population standard deviations are fitted on the 640 fitting rows only; each standard deviation is floored at 1e-12. Predictions are transformed back to pixel coordinates before scoring.",
